%% Sequence: In-ride realtime tracking + state transitions
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor C as Khách hàng
    actor D as Tài xế
    participant WS as Socket.IO Gateway
    participant L as LocationService
    participant R as RidesService
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant EB as EventBus

    Note over D: Sau khi accept offer<br/>(ride=MATCHED)

    C->>WS: subscribe ride:{rideId}<br/>(JWT + ownership check)
    WS-->>C: subscribed

    loop Mỗi 3-5 giây
        D->>WS: emit driver.location.update<br/>{lat, lng}
        WS->>L: acceptLocation(driverId, lat, lng)
        L->>L: validate speed/jump
        L->>REDIS: SET h3 index +<br/>cache last location
        L->>EB: emit driver.location-updated
        EB->>WS: forward tới room ride:{rideId}
        WS-->>C: ride.driver-location
    end

    D->>WS: ride.transition Arrived
    WS->>R: transition(rideId, ARRIVED)
    R->>R: validate transition map
    R->>DB: UPDATE ride status
    R->>EB: emit ride.status-changed
    EB->>WS: broadcast room
    WS-->>C: ride.status-changed ARRIVED

    D->>WS: ride.transition Start
    WS->>R: transition(rideId, IN_RIDE)
    R->>DB: UPDATE
    R->>EB: emit
    WS-->>C: ride.status-changed IN_RIDE

    D->>WS: ride.transition Complete
    WS->>R: transition(rideId, COMPLETED)
    R->>DB: UPDATE ride.completed_at
    R->>EB: emit ride.completed
    WS-->>C: ride.status-changed COMPLETED

    Note over EB: PaymentService<br/>lắng nghe ride.completed<br/>(xem sequence 09)
